1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,050
Imagine someone

2
00:00:01,100 --> 00:00:03,209
hands you an envelope.

3
00:00:03,919 --> 00:00:06,269
Inside is one date.

4
00:00:06,860 --> 00:00:07,270
The day

5
00:00:07,320 --> 00:00:09,349
your life ends.

6
00:00:10,320 --> 00:00:11,069
Maybe you'd

7
00:00:11,119 --> 00:00:12,109
stop waiting.

8
00:00:12,779 --> 00:00:14,109
Say the things.

9
00:00:14,919 --> 00:00:16,009
Live every day

10
00:00:16,059 --> 00:00:17,830
on purpose.

11
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:20,469
Or maybe…

12
00:00:20,519 --> 00:00:22,849
not knowing is what

13
00:00:22,899 --> 00:00:24,730
lets you breathe.

14
00:00:25,800 --> 00:00:26,390
One life

15
00:00:26,440 --> 00:00:27,970
counts its days.

16
00:00:28,579 --> 00:00:29,230
The other never

17
00:00:29,280 --> 00:00:31,370
counts at all.

18
00:00:32,140 --> 00:00:33,250
Neither is wrong.

19
00:00:33,719 --> 00:00:35,410
Both take courage.

20
00:00:38,259 --> 00:00:38,929
So…

21
00:00:38,979 --> 00:00:40,840
would you open it?

